      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">East of the city the ground changes. Geoscience Australia maps brown silty clay over much of eastern Perth, so a new crack in Midland, Kalamunda or Mundaring deserves a proper look from an independent structural engineer.</p>
